@startuml
[*] --> Idle
Idle --> WaitingForPIN : Card Inserted
WaitingForPIN --> ValidatingPIN : PIN Entered
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForPIN : Invalid PIN / Invalid PIN Prompt
ValidatingPIN --> WaitingForChoice : Valid PIN
ValidatingPIN --> Confiscating : Third Invalid PIN
WaitingForPIN --> Ejecting : Cancel
ValidatingPIN --> Ejecting : Cancel
WaitingForChoice --> Ejecting : Cancel
Ejecting --> [*] : Completion Event
@enduml
